<p>Dooms all enemies within a radius 2 ball for 20 turns. Each time an affected target uses a talent, it takes <acronym class="variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00,<br>spellpower 100">59, 79, 95, 108, 120</acronym> physical damage as its life is drawn out. In addition, any bleed applied to the target will have its power increased by <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">15%, 26%, 35%, 43%, 50%.</acronym></p><p>The damage will increase with your Spellpower.</p><p>The chance to apply will increase with your Spellpower.</p>